{"path":"/zh/patterns/p1-context-triage/cases/liangbo/","title":"P1 · 上下文分诊 · 东方屹腾执行型 Agent","blocks":[{"block_id":"adps-85194ff47621bba1-1","revision":"85194ff47621bba11e0ddfd5b8f2d85fd3babb6da03bafd381374abe3a00b11f","tag":"p","quote":"模式矩阵/P1 上下文分诊/蓝皮书"},{"block_id":"adps-968c26d250ed1931-1","revision":"968c26d250ed19313f6efcced367f4f4765c7abb02cf1d03d9f4aa97f3238794","tag":"table","quote":"字段 值 主模式 P1 上下文分诊 Context Triage（感知 × 路由） 结合模式 M3 进度追踪 Progress Tracking 案例 上海东方屹腾科技 · HR/薪酬 SaaS · 服务 2 万+ 企业 · 执行型 Agent 对应白皮书 /zh/patterns/p1-context-triage/ 源 梁博 AICon 逐字稿第六章 · PPT 第 25 页 工程结论 在关键推理入口，根据当前任务从里程碑台账投影上下文；原始目标固定注入，历史进展按相关性裁剪。"},{"block_id":"adps-bb58ade352136c17-1","revision":"bb58ade352136c17a183373e4d6903d009f29214dbb74892722bacf67571dda3","tag":"p","quote":"东方屹腾的一次完整任务会跨越意图识别、链式推理、ReAct、任务规划和工具执行，通常包含十余次模型调用。后段推理同时需要用户原始目标和前序进展，但不能加载全部历史。"},{"block_id":"adps-a90f54c4c9fe0c91-1","revision":"a90f54c4c9fe0c91e6534a074539d5d09233de7a97fdd37d90b174a05e960db4","tag":"p","quote":"单向传递“上一步输出”会逐步稀释原始目标。把全部会话和工具结果加入 Prompt，则会增加上下文长度，并使当前步骤需要的信息难以定位。上下文分诊负责在每个关键推理入口决定加载哪些叙事信息。"},{"block_id":"adps-8a8505c50e196c45-1","revision":"8a8505c50e196c45ab1a12ca589d1aec2338fdf3ee5e2c6663c062a3f54bb373","tag":"p","quote":"叙事状态由三个部分组成："},{"block_id":"adps-01f6c48cee7dd6fd-1","revision":"01f6c48cee7dd6fdd7b5c82ebb4b268b532c6b28a41059d94d9b629706e95bb2","tag":"table","quote":"数据 职责 读取策略 Anchor 保存用户原始目标 每次关键推理固定加载 Ledger 追加关键里程碑摘要 持久化，不直接全量注入 Collection 当前步骤的 Ledger 投影 临时生成，用后释放"},{"block_id":"adps-66f97f2492485049-1","revision":"66f97f24924850498465dbccbc361fe641aa0a60085d8646ac9d06af294dba4d","tag":"p","quote":"P1 处理的是从 Ledger 到 Collection 的读取决策。Ledger 如何写入和维护属于 M3 进度追踪。"},{"block_id":"adps-deab7bb634aaa857-1","revision":"deab7bb634aaa85748421f8cc55f20ded9da385731e3c083ce060c8252bb5b0f","tag":"pre","quote":"当前任务 + 推理阶段 + 上下文预算 -> 读取 Anchor -> 筛选 Ledger 事件 -> 按相关性、时效和权限排序 -> 生成 Collection -> 组装 ReasonContext"},{"block_id":"adps-728f6e3fac2c119f-1","revision":"728f6e3fac2c119f0f0715c618db8b68ff65ad23279040daa60b5b4bb49667fd","tag":"p","quote":"Anchor 不参与压缩。Ledger 事件应保留类型、时间、任务节点、摘要和原始事实引用。Collection 根据当前步骤动态生成，同一份 Ledger 在规划、ReAct 和回复合成阶段会产生不同投影。"},{"block_id":"adps-4f6d7cc63d953871-1","revision":"4f6d7cc63d953871878ea9264154e5f191aa7d525329b8ecfe68e14b3882119b","tag":"li","quote":"与当前目标和步骤的语义相关性；"},{"block_id":"adps-f90edb7d441af773-1","revision":"f90edb7d441af773a767a18676e98e8c6a22fce0c6fc9a1a4a8211e0f0bcf240","tag":"li","quote":"事件是否改变任务状态或业务前提；"},{"block_id":"adps-afd43310411330bb-1","revision":"afd43310411330bbcea68ba9ee9c276f7443b9abce0e039e82d6cfcb527de3fc","tag":"p","quote":"用户在上一轮确认薪资组建议，下一轮只输入“继续”。当前输入本身不含完整目标。上下文组装器读取 Anchor 中的薪资组配置目标，再从 Ledger 中选择已完成的模板匹配、用户确认和快照状态摘要，生成当前 Collection。"},{"block_id":"adps-df7bbe9dc5147a86-1","revision":"df7bbe9dc5147a8634e6bd65d9422548e850a0310501577acdb494fdf7e3c003","tag":"p","quote":"模板 ID 不从 Collection 传入工具。Collection 只提供“模板已匹配”等语义进展，实际 ID 由机械状态平面读取。"},{"block_id":"adps-52ffcfa3464e76cd-1","revision":"52ffcfa3464e76cd0856f977688f4fa8cdb9ea2d383bc3f5fe55b9b110875927","tag":"li","quote":"Anchor 被摘要覆盖或没有进入后段推理；"},{"block_id":"adps-7629b046eb2462f1-1","revision":"7629b046eb2462f199135671bd3e83a171e66ea7b41204d62e7e777ac04a06bf","tag":"li","quote":"Ledger 已压缩，便被每次全量注入；"},{"block_id":"adps-0d6a6d8a2d80fdb1-1","revision":"0d6a6d8a2d80fdb1fef74ef89b16a7f19c75e096645b2950dca1b3b9e6fe610d","tag":"li","quote":"Collection 是固定全局摘要，没有根据步骤变化；"},{"block_id":"adps-e088256d046dd924-1","revision":"e088256d046dd924e53bd1f104efe9f08f9de4559990b4d44b882d9fac56ba17","tag":"li","quote":"投影只按语义相似度，遗漏状态变化和约束；"},{"block_id":"adps-9d76de4df225690f-1","revision":"9d76de4df225690f8f7f9e8bbb22afa7794b6a321007e919a77cd32301efac9b","tag":"li","quote":"机械参数或任务调度状态把叙事投影当作真源；"},{"block_id":"adps-b897f9f67570c982-1","revision":"b897f9f67570c982f7d2b21979aac03065b4db2d7f213faf7f0332c479b1f15b","tag":"li","quote":"用户输入“继续”后，任务无法恢复到原始目标。"},{"block_id":"adps-948834dc6a80ff94-1","revision":"948834dc6a80ff9454bae7c37f2d172efcf6843753fb249ce6f33848ce482909","tag":"li","quote":"关键推理入口的 Anchor 注入率；"},{"block_id":"adps-2732a5d45a8831b7-1","revision":"2732a5d45a8831b722c42a64e85a7bca44f556de4fa460b8dd42bde82e13b28d","tag":"li","quote":"Collection 中关键里程碑召回率；"},{"block_id":"adps-2f07ee032cacfae0-1","revision":"2f07ee032cacfae021e6383335e0923a135bf69f483263701fae939dc93b8147","tag":"li","quote":"无关事件占比和上下文 Token 数；"},{"block_id":"adps-9990fe61d2f1ac49-1","revision":"9990fe61d2f1ac496f77435c96d09bc9a28f5914fc52987a0d67a85a2592300b","tag":"li","quote":"后段计划与原始目标的一致率；"},{"block_id":"adps-a8d2b3eb621b7a45-1","revision":"a8d2b3eb621b7a458c2f39abad884ca7eb27114596229a7f16c0b325187aad3d","tag":"li","quote":"因上下文缺失导致的重复执行和错误规划次数；"},{"block_id":"adps-c62684f553b40625-1","revision":"c62684f553b4062551cfc0060b5eb4a49552bb12d5b81f574c13e2d647947e41","tag":"li","quote":"不同投影规则在真实长链路任务上的成功率和成本。"},{"block_id":"adps-dd4751cf4910c7ed-1","revision":"dd4751cf4910c7edaa46ed3f0bf0fdd75f10bda659f147d6386403de32aa613e","tag":"p","quote":"P1 白皮书把上下文分诊定义为窗口分配问题：候选信息超过预算时，根据优先级和用途决定加载顺序。东方屹腾的 Anchor 对应固定优先级约束，Collection 对应按当前任务生成的上下文路由结果。"},{"block_id":"adps-c73c3b4c4d7e5fc5-1","revision":"c73c3b4c4d7e5fc5321769aacbbbbf5d3c2608e6d9ced6d6a7e9de86ad9acf78","tag":"p","quote":"当单次任务跨多次模型调用，后段推理依赖原始目标和前序里程碑时，应采用上下文分诊。短链路单轮任务可以直接使用消息历史。若里程碑类型高度开放，需要先建立事件分类和来源元数据，再设计投影规则。"},{"block_id":"adps-548c87395fdb386e-1","revision":"548c87395fdb386e0a68bf26647c6ffa041aac97c276587f5ad37bf26dadccb8","tag":"p","quote":"引用建议：ADPS、梁博，《东方屹腾 · 上下文分诊》，企业 Agent 系统蓝皮书 v0.4，2026-08-02。"},{"block_id":"adps-07336cb1f093d306-1","revision":"07336cb1f093d306f9f6694518f0138fa9925bd53440f26b6e21d427504c348d","tag":"p","quote":"案例报告目录 · 模式目录 · CC BY 4.0"},{"block_id":"adps-79480e7125ad6903-1","revision":"79480e7125ad690354825fcdaaf560618dbc0f310b5df40f3f9e4ed205348fd8","tag":"p","quote":"证据边界：本页是完整案例的模式切片，记录特定系统约束下的实现选择。案例方提供的实现与效果信息未经过独立审计，不构成通用性能承诺。"},{"block_id":"adps-3c551855df185a69-1","revision":"3c551855df185a69bba5e6c436054cab73b1e5df7050f512e066b3f937c0e637","tag":"p","quote":"在 ADPS Chronicle 中查看"}]}
